        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    \n    <!-- Title -->\n    <h1>Mysteries Unveiled: The Secrets of Ancient Civilizations</h1>\n    \n    <!-- informational paragraph -->\n    <p>Dive into the depths of history to uncover the mysteries that ancient civilizations left behind. From the architectural marvels of the Egyptians to the advanced astronomical knowledge of the Mayans, each civilization carried its own secrets and innovations. These societies have shaped our understanding of engineering, astronomy, mathematics, and philosophy. Explore the remnants of these ancient worlds to discover the genius that laid the foundations for modern science and culture.</p> \n    \n    <!-- gallery for image and link -->\n    <div class=\"gallery\">\n      <div class=\"link-card\">\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"pyramids.png\" alt=\"Egyptian pyramids\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <a class=\"egyptians\" href=\"https://www.history.com/news/ancient-egypt-pyramid-ramp-discovery\">Find out how the Egyptians build the pyramids!</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n      <div class=\"link-card\">\n        <div>\n          <img src=\"mayanGlyphs.png\" alt=\"Mayan glyphs\">\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <a class=\"mayans\" href=\"https://www.history.com/topics/ancient-americas/mayan-scientific-achievements\">Find out more about the Mayan's advanced knowledge of astronomy and technology!</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"citation\">\n      <p>All images created by chatGPT<br>CC0 1.0</p>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* FIND AND FIX THE BUGS FOR THE ANCHOR TAG STATES */\n\n.egyptians.link {\n  font-family:Arial;\n  color:#0014ff;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\negyptians.hover {\n  color: #f7f8fd;\n  background-color: #2f35ff;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-decoration-style: wavy;\n  border-radius: 7px;\n}\n\n.mayans.link {\n  font-family:Verdana;\n  color:#a80707;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\nmayans:hover {\n  color: #f7f8fd;\n  background-color: #a80707;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-decoration-style: wavy;\n  border-radius: 7px;\n}\n\n/* body style */\nbody {\n  background-color: #ffd9d9;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-family: Arial;\n  font-size: 36px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\np {\n  font-family: Arial;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n.gallery {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  justify-content: space-around;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.link-card {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n\nimg {\n  border-style: solid;\n  border-radius: 15px;\n  width: 300px;\n  margin: 15px;\n}\n\n.citation {\n  height: 300px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n}\n\n.citation > p {\n  text-align: center;\n  font-style: italic;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
